 sitting side by side  how did you do this husky dad me and  Roxy hanging out thank you family okay  this one's from Texas whoa whoa  Swarovski pens with my name on them but  the only thing is I'm not a do and MD  I'm just the deal problematic this is  from Hungary and I've been to Hungary  many at times not many a times I've been  there twice I imagine this is gonna be a  drawing cuz it's with some really heavy  cardboard there let's see dear Mike I  couldn't decide so I did both hope you  liked it best regards me what this is by  far the best drawing I've ever seen you  give me in my life this is pencil folks  is this ridiculous or what do these are  amazing I'm gonna have these frames I  don't know where I'm gonna put them coz  it's kind of awkward hanging pictures of  yourself in your own house but these are  amazing like this looks like me beuh  Smith or be a Smith please send me your  Instagram I want to put this on my story  and share this with the world your heart  is amazing I mean like you can't draw  better than that this is from Ohio okay  okay here we go we got sucks get out of  here  sucks with Roxie and bears face on them  come on now come on I'm gonna wear these  to work  and people get a judge mean I don't even  care at all Thank You Kenyatta very much  appreciated stay being an awesome nurse  I send you a t-shirt I make a tower  small family farm I guess you were a  large or extra-large so whichever one  doesn't fit feel free to do whatever you  want with it okay this is a very  interesting shirt support your local  beekeeper I'm down with that but why is  the be throwing up fun fact all my  videos are now captioned in English and  Spanish so click here to check this one  out and have a good laugh as always stay  happy and healthy  [Music]

